{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/10fcf1b05e7b406bf98a5f6f1ac92c6a.poster.avif?t=1757458103\" width=602 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/10fcf1b05e7b406bf98a5f6f1ac92c6a.webm?t=1757458103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/10fcf1b05e7b406bf98a5f6f1ac92c6a.mp4?t=1757458103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Re - Fracture : The Prophet's Awakening\u00a0</strong>is a <strong>Traversal themed RPG</strong> where momentum is your greatest weapon. As <strong>Shaiden Wreath</strong>, you will master <strong>Shadow-based abilities</strong>\u00a0allowing you to chain together aerial manoeuvres, teleport past obstacles, and uncover the truth behind the <strong>Collapse</strong>, and your missing brother, Siege.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Traversal-Heavy RPG</strong> complemented by <strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> and a <strong>Robust Dialogue System</strong>, Re - Fracture offers players a high-speed, fluid movement system where every rooftop, ledge, and wall is part of the playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leap between towering buildings, execute seamless teleports, and outmanoeuvre foes in a world built for movement.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/80d345b7117947fe370dca102e7c6545.poster.avif?t=1757458103\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/80d345b7117947fe370dca102e7c6545.webm?t=1757458103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/80d345b7117947fe370dca102e7c6545.mp4?t=1757458103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Traversal System</strong> \u2013 Surge, blink, and warp effortlessly through an interconnected city, mastering movement-based abilities like <strong>Phantom Vault</strong> and <strong>Phantom Reach</strong> to navigate obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat (In Development)</strong> \u2013 Strike with <strong>Shadow Slashes</strong>, phase through enemy attacks, and chain together warps for devastating finishers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Story &amp; Dialogue</strong> \u2013 Unravel the mystery of <strong>Siege and the Collapse</strong> through dynamic dialogue and world interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Side Activities</strong> \u2013 Challenge yourself with <strong>Time Trial Races</strong>, test your skills in <strong>environmental puzzles</strong>, or dive into <strong>Drifta\u2019s underground rap scene</strong> in a unique rhythm-based mini-game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the unknown, master the shadows, and <strong>carve Shaiden's destiny in Re- Fracture</strong>...<br><br>\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Development Status</strong><br>Re-Fracture: The Prophet\u2019s Awakening is currently in <strong>pre-alpha</strong>. The build represents an early stage of development, and features, content, and systems will continue to evolve over time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3462180?t=1757458103","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3462180?t=1757458103","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto