ph\" ><strong>Leap between towering buildings, execute seamless teleports, and outmanoeuvre foes in a world built for movement.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/80d345b7117947fe370dca102e7c6545.poster.avif?t=1757458103\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/80d345b7117947fe370dca102e7c6545.webm?t=1757458103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/80d345b7117947fe370dca102e7c6545.mp4?t=1757458103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Traversal System</strong> \u2013 Surge, blink, and warp effortlessly through an interconnected city, mastering movement-based abilities like <strong>Phantom Vault</strong> and <strong>Phantom Reach</strong> to navigate obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat (In Development)</strong> \u2013 Strike with <strong>Shadow Slashes</strong>, phase through enemy attacks, and chain together warps for devastating finishers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Story &amp; Dialogue</strong> \u2013 Unravel the mystery of <strong>Siege and the Collapse</strong> through dynamic dialogue and world interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Side Activities</strong> \u2013 Challenge yourself with <strong>Time Trial Races</strong>, test your skills in <strong>environmental puzzles</strong>, or dive into <strong>Drifta\u2019s underground rap scene</strong> in a unique rhythm-based mini-game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the unknown, master the shadows, and <strong>carve Shaiden's destiny in Re- Fracture</strong>...<br><br>\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Development Status</strong><br>Re-Fracture: The Prophet\u2019s Awakening is currently in <strong>pre-alpha</strong>. The build represents an early stage of development, and features, content, and systems will continue to evolve over time.</p>","developers":["Project Contrast"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/ea32080a48ebc702336ef1a7618daa8b93c5c267/header.jpg?t=1757458103","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257184606,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184606/movie480.mp4?t=1756565912","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184606/movie_max.mp4?t=1756565912"},"name":"RE-Fracture","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184606/446c14da34b5739a21d39538595ab462b2dd520d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756565912","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184606/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756565912","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184606/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756565912"}}],"name":"Re \u2013 Fracture: The Prophet\u2019s Awakening","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 Ti (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not required</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS: